<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of ecuadorean coffee, effective from December 26 to January 1 the 1997.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 105.10</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$  97.07</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  47.35</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  85.93</p>
</text>
